# W44-93 try_dct64 gate widening A/B — HONEST-STOP (2026-05-19)

## TL;DR

Per W44-92 Recommendation A: change `try_dct64: effort >= 7` →
`try_dct64: effort >= 5` in `src/effort.rs:794` (parity with `try_dct32`)
to match libjxl's gate (`decoding_speed_tier < 4`, NOT effort).

**Honest-stop.** Cardinal gates failed:
- Target cell 1531677 e5 d=6 did NOT close (delta 5.40% → 3.90%, still > 3.0%).
- 1 NEW infrastructure failure: imac_g3 e9 d=3 OOMs at 2 GiB default
  memory cap (DCT64 evaluation adds memory pressure on 5.6 MP × 4
  butteraugli iters).
- 19 cells with SSIM2 drops ≥ 0.3, max -1.21 on 1189261 e6 d=6
  (photo cells lose quality to gain bytes).
- 1418519 e6 d=6: -9.89% bytes for -2.22 SSIM2 vs cjxl — the same
  rate-quality tradeoff W44-38 honest-stopped on at e6 widening.

Source REVERTED to `try_dct64: effort >= 7` (with explanatory comment
added pointing to this honest-stop). Bench TSV + meta retained as the
permanent record.

